From ad4923928450862c32f9b049381070387f67c7dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Utah package factory <noreply@projectbluefin.io>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 04:25:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1004/1004] cargo: Build with crates.io fluent and without the
 FTL tooling

fish pins a fork of fluent-rs and fluent-ftl-tools, which exist only as
git repositories. The fork's single change makes fluent_syntax's Parser
public for fluent-ftl-tools; fish itself builds against crates.io fluent
0.17.0. fluent-ftl-tools only serves the fluent-extract feature (the
fluent-extraction proc-macro), the xtask fluent and FTL-format commands
and one FTL consistency test, so drop those.
---
 Cargo.toml                 | 12 +++---------
 crates/fluent/Cargo.toml   |  5 -----
 crates/fluent/src/lib.rs   | 23 -----------------------
 crates/xtask/Cargo.toml    |  2 --
 crates/xtask/src/format.rs | 26 --------------------------
 crates/xtask/src/lib.rs    |  1 -
 crates/xtask/src/main.rs   |  6 +-----
 7 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 71 deletions(-)

